==Trivia==  
* The Third Sea holds the title of having the least number of islands (8); however, more are to come. It also could be counted as 13 islands, as there are several mini-islands in the [[Sea of Treats]] or 17 if the [[Mirage Island]], [[Kitsune Island]], [[Treasure Island]], [[Frozen Dimension]] and [[Prehistoric Island]] are included.
* The enemies past the [[Ice Cream Land]] (Sea of Treats) use [[Aura]], nullifying [[Elemental]] Reflex even if the player surpasses the required [[Level]].

